  "worked_solution": "To find every subset of $P,$ we list out every combination of elements within $P.$ \n\nWe can use the following diagram to visualize the process:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038640/assets/17d796ca9f78e72d15b6f29565d03a5ea42c1e2fe544acd02bc3f368993cdb9c.png)\n\nNote that we must include the empty set, since it is a subset of every set.\n\nBy doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\u2205,{10},{20},{10,20}.\n$$",
